d":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-o043"]},{"id":"houfei-m-o044-mingdi-p0009","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-o044"]},{"id":"houfei-m-o048-mingdi-p0009","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-o048"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-o043a-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-927eadf04ccad0cdc935","layer":"original","quote":"明悼毛皇后，河内人也。黄初中，以选入东宫。明帝时为平原王，进御有宠，出入与同舆辇。及即帝位，以为贵嫔。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-e-o043b-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-927eadf04ccad0cdc935","layer":"original","quote":"明悼毛皇后，河内人也。黄初中，以选入东宫。明帝时为平原王，进御有宠，出入与同舆辇。及即帝位，以为贵嫔。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-e-o044a-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-ab194449d314cad9ca12","layer":"original","quote":"大和元年，立为皇后。后父嘉，拜骑都尉；后弟曾，郎中。初，明帝为王，始纳河内虞氏为妃。帝即位，虞氏不得立为后，太皇卞太后慰勉焉。虞氏曰：“曹氏自好立贱〖1〗，未有能以义举者也。然后职内事〖2〗，君听外政，其道相由而成；苟不能以善始，未有能令终者也。殆必由此亡国丧祀矣〖3〗！”虞氏遂黜还邺宫。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":145,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-e-o048b-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-fd992a8af87f0d1fe23b","layer":"original","quote":"后知之。明日，帝见后，后曰：“昨日游宴北园，乐乎？”帝以左右泄之，所杀十余人。赐后死，","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":217,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":76,"end":119,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-f0011-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-927eadf04ccad0cdc935","layer":"original","quote":"河内人也","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":6,"end":10,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-f0019-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-927eadf04ccad0cdc935","layer":"original","quote":"明悼毛皇后","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":5,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o014","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-87bc74c5c9a764cda8ec","layer":"original","quote":"初，太后弟秉，以功封都乡侯。黄初七年，进封开阳侯，邑千二百户，为昭烈将军〖15〗。﹝二﹞秉薨，子兰嗣。少有才学，﹝三﹞为奉车都尉，游击将军〖16〗，加散骑常侍。兰薨，子晖嗣。﹝四﹞又分秉爵，封兰弟琳为列侯，官至步兵校尉。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":46,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o043","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-927eadf04ccad0cdc935","layer":"original","quote":"明悼毛皇后，河内人也。黄初中，以选入东宫。明帝时为平原王，进御有宠，出入与同舆辇。及即帝位，以为贵嫔。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o044","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-ab194449d314cad9ca12","layer":"original","quote":"大和元年，立为皇后。后父嘉，拜骑都尉；后弟曾，郎中。初，明帝为王，始纳河内虞氏为妃。帝即位，虞氏不得立为后，太皇卞太后慰勉焉。虞氏曰：“曹氏自好立贱〖1〗，未有能以义举者也。然后职内事〖2〗，君听外政，其道相由而成；苟不能以善始，未有能令终者也。殆必由此亡国丧祀矣〖3〗！”虞氏遂黜还邺宫。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":145,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-o048","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-fd992a8af87f0d1fe23b","layer":"original","quote":"帝之幸郭元后也〖10〗，后爱宠日弛。景初元年，帝游后园，召才人以上，曲宴极乐〖11〗。元后曰：“宜延皇后〖12〗。”帝弗许。乃禁左右，使不得宣〖13〗。后知之。明日，帝见后，后曰：“昨日游宴北园，乐乎？”帝以左右泄之，所杀十余人。赐后死，然犹加谥，葬愍陵；迁曾散骑常侍，后徙为羽林、虎贲中郎将、原武典农〖14〗。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":217,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":156,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o007c-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-3b980088f10c9823d34d","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，丙寅〖11〗，治兵于东郊。焉耆王遣子入侍〖12〗。十一月，立皇后毛氏〖13〗。赐天下男子爵，人二级；鳏寡孤独不能自存者，赐谷。十二月，封后父毛嘉为列侯。新城太守孟达反〖14〗，诏骠骑将军司马宣王讨之。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":33,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o057c-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-981559cdc570ab57c8f2","layer":"original","quote":"诏青、兖、幽、冀四州大作海船〖11〗。九月，冀、兖、徐、豫四州民，遇水〖12〗。遣侍御史循行没溺死亡及失财产者〖13〗，在所开仓赈救之〖14〗。庚辰〖15〗，皇后毛氏卒。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":399,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-76fba510250937628a99","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：太和二年（公元 228）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-38a74578b09178cb1fd4","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：景初二年（公元 238 ）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":438,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-917b5dc4aecce5a0dcf4","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗七年：黄初七年（公元226）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7290e2008f81d6cad349","start":0,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o001","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-fe69417d79b76e276a24","layer":"original","quote":"明皇帝讳叡，字元仲。文帝太子也。生而太祖爱之，常令在左右。﹝一﹞年十五，封武德侯。黄初二年为齐公。三年为平原王〖1〗。以其母诛，故未建为嗣。﹝二﹞七年夏五月〖2〗，帝病笃，乃立为皇太子。丁巳〖3〗，即皇帝位。大赦；尊皇太后曰太皇太后〖4〗，皇后曰皇太后〖5〗；诸臣封爵各有差。﹝三﹞〔六月〕，癸未〖6〗，追谥母甄夫人曰文昭皇后〖7〗。壬辰〖8〗，立皇弟蕤为阳平王〖9〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":185,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o004","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-3d867ec3331f738aeaf5","layer":"original","quote":"太和元年春正月，郊祀武皇帝，以配天；宗祀文皇帝于明堂，以配上帝〖1〗。分江夏南部，置江夏南部都尉。西平麹英反，杀临羌令、西都长〖2〗。遣将军郝昭、鹿磐，讨斩之。二月，辛未〖3〗，帝耕于籍田。辛巳〖4〗，立文昭皇后寝庙于邺。丁亥〖5〗，朝日于东郊。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o007","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-3b980088f10c9823d34d","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，丙寅〖11〗，治兵于东郊。焉耆王遣子入侍〖12〗。十一月，立皇后毛氏〖13〗。赐天下男子爵，人二级；鳏寡孤独不能自存者，赐谷。十二月，封后父毛嘉为列侯。新城太守孟达反〖14〗，诏骠骑将军司马宣王讨之。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":33,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o008","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-bec9198de0001b0aa26c","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，宣王攻破新城。斩达，传其首〖2〗。﹝一﹞分新城之上庸、武陵、巫县为上庸郡〖3〗，锡县为锡郡。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o052","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-26b7ecd6c3ecce777040","layer":"original","quote":"景初元年春（正）〔二〕月，壬辰〖1〗，山茌县言黄龙现〖2〗。﹝一﹞于是有司奏，以为魏得地统〖3〗，宜以建丑之月为正〖4〗。三月，定历改年为孟夏四月；﹝二﹞服色尚黄〖5〗；牺牲用白〖6〗；戎事乘黑首白马〖7〗，建大赤之旂〖8〗；朝会，建大白之旗。﹝三﹞改太和历曰景初历〖9〗：其春夏秋冬孟仲季月，虽与正岁不同〖10〗，至于郊祀、迎气、礿祠、蒸尝、巡狩、蒐田、分至启闭、班宣时令、中气早晚、敬授民事〖11〗，皆以正岁斗建为历数之序〖12〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":363,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":218,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o057","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-981559cdc570ab57c8f2","layer":"original","quote":"诏青、兖、幽、冀四州大作海船〖11〗。九月，冀、兖、徐、豫四州民，遇水〖12〗。遣侍御史循行没溺死亡及失财产者〖13〗，在所开仓赈救之〖14〗。庚辰〖15〗，皇后毛氏卒。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":399,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o058","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-a2135e58bed7e5b9f811","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，丁未〖16〗，月犯荧惑。癸丑〖17〗，葬悼毛后于愍陵〖18〗。乙卯〖19〗，营洛阳南委粟山为圜丘〖20〗。﹝一﹞十二月，壬子冬至〖21〗，始祀〖22〗。丁巳〖23〗，分襄阳临沮、宜城、旍阳、邔四县〖24〗，﹝二﹞置襄阳南部都尉。己未〖25〗，有司奏文昭皇后立庙京都。分襄阳郡之鄀、叶县属义阳郡〖26〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":158,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o059","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5790b2efe14805978c50","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，诏太尉司马宣王。率众讨辽东。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xinyang-q-801a4c9b6ec04b2aff74","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-66365b15e10a5fc0fa23","layer":"original","quote":"帝愈增崇宫殿，雕饰观阁；凿太行之石英〖1〗，采穀城之文石〖2〗；起景阳山于芳林之园〖3〗，建昭阳殿于太极之北〖4〗；铸作黄龙、凤凰、奇伟之兽，饰金墉、陵云台、陵霄阙〖5〗。百役繁兴，作者万数；公卿以下至于学生，莫不展力；帝乃躬自掘土以率之。而辽东不朝〖6〗，悼皇后崩〖7〗；天作淫雨，冀州水出，漂没民物。","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":443,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":152,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{"mingdi-p0009":{"fields":[{"id":"houfei-f0011","key":"home","label":"籍贯","text":"河内","evidence":["houfei-f0011-q"]}],"directory":{"faction":"wei"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
